{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46 五期生の佐藤優羽です│ ˙ᵕ˙ )꜆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは、私のブログを開いてくださり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます( .ˬ. )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お会いできて嬉しいです( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日、8月1日（土）は"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "17th Single「Kind of love」発売記念"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリートが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都にて行われました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お越しくださったみなさま、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました( .ˬ.)\""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobL3aedu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobazAV6f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📷⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日は藤の柄の浴衣を着て、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさまをお待ちしていました😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今シングルのリアルミーグリは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京・京都の両方の会場で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浴衣を着ていました( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私とお話してくださったあの時間が、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさまにとって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切な夏の思い出でありますように*･ﾟ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさまが私にまた会いたいなと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思ってくださっていたら嬉しいです…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひまたお話しましょうね🪽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な祝花もありがとうございました…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またブログで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お礼を伝えさせていただきたいので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しお時間をくださいね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます( .ˬ.)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりの京都は東京よりも少し暑くて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "より夏らしさがあって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごく楽しむことができました🍉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさまと過ごした今年の夏も、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとっての青い春です( ˙˙)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日は本当にありがとうございました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日8月1日は高井俐香のお誕生日です🎂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お誕生日おめでとう、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短い間だけれど同い年期間を"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しもうね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい一年にしようね…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またツーショットもお見せしますね📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまでお付き合いくださり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最新のスケジュールなどは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公式サイトよりご確認ください( .ˬ.)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46公式サイト"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい夢を(՞- -՞)ᶻᶻᶻ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#satoyublog"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "/94"}], "source": "official"}